#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:5 fca2bbf232664d06b90df1309bff61cb
msgid "Archived: Debugging using JTAG"
msgstr "存档：使用 JTAG 调试"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:8 2eae13636ab7480fb1d7cbc9f9946c1c
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:10 c3a127f0305e460690e540832421f695
msgid ""
"The JTAG interface on APM provides additional debugging features that can be"
" useful when working on certain kinds of problems. This page describes how "
"to configure your APM setup so that you can use JTAG to debug it."
msgstr ""
"APM 上的 JTAG 接口提供了额外的调试功能，在处理某些类型的问题时非常有用。本页面介绍如何配置您的 APM 以便使用 JTAG 进行调试。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:15 60f63b65abe74be9ab6ad96da16a2377
msgid ""
"Note that enabling JTAG disables the ADC4, ADC5, ADC6 and ADC7 pins. These "
"aren't normally used by APM, but if your application requires more than the "
"low four ADC inputs, you won't be able to use JTAG."
msgstr ""
"请注意，启用 JTAG 会禁用 ADC4、ADC5、ADC6 和 ADC7 引脚。APM 通常不使用这些引脚，但如果您的应用需要超过低四路的 ADC "
"输入，则无法使用 JTAG。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:20 cfcda6c329684c6a957f1cdb38ba2d46
msgid "Hardware Required"
msgstr "所需硬件"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:22 42a9a27592f14d6ca728843ef34c646d
msgid ""
"Obviously you will need an APM board. The JTAG signals are available on the "
"oilpan, so we will assume you are using one as well. For other boards (e.g. "
"Arduino Mega) see your board's documentation for the location of the "
"relevant pins."
msgstr ""
"显然，您需要一块 APM 主板。JTAG 信号可在 oilpan 上获取，因此我们假设您也在使用 oilpan。对于其他主板（如 Arduino "
"Mega），请参阅您的主板文档以了解相关引脚位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:27 33cda5e51f7349259ce94c1cc39fe7be
msgid ""
"To program the JTAG and OCD fuses in the ATMega1280 an ISP programmer of "
"some sort is required. This article describes using the cheap and effective "
"!BusPirate, but another programmer (e.g. STK500, GoodFET, etc.) could also "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"要烧写 ATMega1280 中的 JTAG 和 OCD 熔丝，需要某种 ISP 编程器。本文介绍使用经济实惠且有效的 "
"!BusPirate，但也可以使用其他编程器（如 STK500、GoodFET 等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:32 e494ac954a4e4eee80e6b50fd2d1ce61
msgid ""
"Last but not least, you will need an AVR JTAG unit. The Atmel JTAGICE mkii "
"works well, but is expensive. This article was developed using the much "
"cheaper JTAGICE mkii-CN from"
msgstr ""
"最后但同样重要的是，您需要一个 AVR JTAG 设备。Atmel JTAGICE mkii 效果很好，但价格昂贵。本文是使用来自以下来源的更便宜的 "
"JTAGICE mkii-CN 开发的"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:36 c7f9eae658cd4a84b0f19ab21a71a7c1
msgid "`http://www.mcuzone.com <http://www.mcuzone.com/>`__"
msgstr "`http://www.mcuzone.com <http://www.mcuzone.com/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:38 ca8e023f6ad848e9b8f7a3fd8cb18397
msgid ""
"obtained via eBay for about 1/3 the price of the Atmel unit. The JTAGICE can"
" be used as a programmer as well."
msgstr "通过 eBay 购得，价格约为 Atmel 原装单元的 1/3。JTAGICE 也可用作编程器。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:41 588c4eb7da994dedae0f5bf22efc7d91
msgid ""
"Note that the mkii-CN unit seems very sensitive to USB setup. If it "
"misbehaves when connected to a hub, try connecting it directly to a port on "
"your system."
msgstr "请注意，mkii-CN 设备对 USB 连接方式似乎非常敏感。如果连接到集线器时出现异常，请尝试直接连接到系统的 USB 端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:46 95fb0f2bc945450faacf723b9e30a1b5
msgid "Software Required"
msgstr "所需软件"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:48 d116003812d5411db7e8765fee342719
msgid "The AVRDUDE and AVaRICE tools are required, as well as avr-gdb."
msgstr "需要 AVRDUDE 和 AVaRICE 工具，以及 avr-gdb。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:50 21f7887c9a094d1cad840ce68432a3a6
msgid ""
"On Windows, all of the required tools should be installed by WinAVR. (TBD: "
"verify whether AVaRICE comes with WinAVR)"
msgstr "在 Windows 上，所有必需工具应通过 WinAVR 安装。（待确认：AVaRICE 是否随 WinAVR 一起提供）"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:53 6aa38dd6ea7f4751838957aeadb67cb7
msgid ""
"On Mac OS the use the MacPorts tool to install the tools. Fetch and install "
"the MacPorts package, then use the following commands:"
msgstr "在 Mac OS 上，使用 MacPorts 工具安装所需工具。获取并安装 MacPorts 软件包，然后使用以下命令："

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:63 64009d8f11b6440784cdb9820d94190f
msgid "You can omit avr-gdb if you already have the AVR CrossPack installed."
msgstr "如果您已安装 AVR CrossPack，可以省略 avr-gdb。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:65 9cfc6a7672d8467aafeb27129762a1af
msgid ""
"Most Linux systems have packages available for avrdude, avarice and avr-gdb."
" See your system management documentation for details on installing these, "
"or ask a friend."
msgstr ""
"大多数 Linux 系统都提供 avrdude、avarice 和 avr-gdb 的软件包。有关安装详情，请参阅您的系统管理文档，或向朋友请教。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:70 d2de0ed8a8ec49a5ae23f468b1212ad0
msgid "Initial Setup"
msgstr "初始设置"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:72 3efaf92a067c494bb19f0d59c6b623c4
msgid ""
"Before debugging, the JTAG Enable and On Chip Debug Enable fuses must be "
"programmed in the ATMega1280. By default both are disabled, and despite "
"offering a tempting option in the boards.txt file, Arduino does not seem to "
"provide a way to change them."
msgstr ""
"在调试之前，必须在 ATMega1280 中烧写 JTAG 使能和片上调试使能熔丝。默认情况下两者都被禁用，尽管 boards.txt "
"文件中提供了诱人的选项，但 Arduino 似乎没有提供更改这些熔丝的方法。"

