#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:194 ab504ca632e342e6b9a55798712d2d3c
msgid ""
"Once the hardware setup is done, there are a variety of ways to debug using "
"JTAG. The following steps cover just the basics."
msgstr "硬件设置完成后，可以通过多种方式使用 JTAG 进行调试。以下步骤仅涵盖基本内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:197 821469fcaadc453086c2818e55dfa762
msgid ""
"The bridge between the JTAG unit and your debugger is AVaRICE. Some setups "
"will automatically launch the tool when the debugger starts, others require "
"that you launch it manually. It is critical for successful APM debugging "
"that the --capture argument is passed to AVaRICE, rather than attempting to "
"download a new program."
msgstr ""
"JTAG 设备与调试器之间的桥梁是 AVaRICE。某些配置会在调试器启动时自动启动该工具，其他配置则需要手动启动。成功调试 APM 的关键是向 "
"AVaRICE 传递 --capture 参数，而不是尝试下载新程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:203 7ded5636b82e472aa5c425c8a97cd562
msgid ""
"To start AVaRICE manually, assuming a JTAGICE mkii (or clone) connected via "
"USB, use:"
msgstr "要手动启动 AVaRICE（假设通过 USB 连接了 JTAGICE mkii 或其克隆版本），请使用："

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:210 d707e0bca665490ca31e1fd2dddc5e63
msgid "You should see output like:"
msgstr "您应该看到如下输出："

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:216 5dc8a559c5804934b997d125a8a39533
msgid "Defaulting JTAG bitrate to 250 kHz."
msgstr "JTAG 比特率默认为 250 kHz。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:218 064b848263f44dbdb50b3aa17cc502ed
msgid ""
"JTAG config starting. Found a device: JTAGICEmkII Serial number: "
"00:a0:00:40:26:63 Reported JTAG device ID: 0x9703 Configured for device ID: "
"0x9703 atmega1280 JTAG config complete. Waiting for connection on port 4242."
msgstr ""
"JTAG 配置启动中。找到设备：JTAGICEmkII 序列号：00:a0:00:40:26:63 上报的 JTAG 设备 ID：0x9703 "
"已配置设备 ID：0x9703 atmega1280 JTAG 配置完成。正在端口 4242 上等待连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:223 a74caa903a5f4987a8f4c785d9eaa393
msgid ""
"Note that AVaRICE will exit every time the debugger disconnects, so be "
"prepared to restart it regularly if your debugger doesn't manage it already."
" Once the \"Waiting for connection\" message is displayed, you are ready to "
"connect with your debugger."
msgstr ""
"请注意，每次调试器断开连接时 AVaRICE 都会退出，因此如果您的调试器没有自动管理，请做好定期重启的准备。一旦显示「Waiting for "
"connection」消息，您就可以连接调试器了。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:229 131550eabc7b4a19b11ad8a2443ba069
msgid "Debugging Code Built by Arduino"
msgstr "调试由 Arduino 构建的代码"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:231 37241c957c3d403c9653737d0d36b46f
msgid ""
"Arduino does its best to hide the dirty parts of the build process from the "
"user. This can make it slightly difficult to find the files that you need "
"for debugging. Hold down the SHIFT key while clicking the Verify button in "
"the Arduino IDE, and you will see the commands executed by Arduino as it "
"builds your sketch. Assuming that the build is successful, the last command "
"listed (before the \"Binary sketch…\" line) will look something like this "
"example taken from a Mac OS system:"
msgstr ""
"Arduino 尽力对用户隐藏构建过程中的繁琐细节，这可能使得查找调试所需文件略显困难。在 Arduino IDE 中按住 SHIFT "
"键并点击「验证」按钮，您将看到 Arduino 构建草图时执行的命令。假设构建成功，最后列出的命令（位于「Binary "
"sketch...」行之前）将类似于以下取自 Mac OS 系统的示例："

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:245 49297033ad664b92a3a243168fac431f
msgid ""
"The file that your debugger will want to load is the .elf file, in this case"
msgstr "调试器需要加载的文件是 .elf 文件，在本例中为"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:248 1be1aeee8b774c1bae0136db801c0dc5
msgid ""
"/var/folders/Bu/Burcn-0aFa4N+++0Me1I2U++1dw/-Tmp-/build159308262941509457.tmp/GPS_AUTO_test.cpp.elf"
msgstr ""
"/var/folders/Bu/Burcn-0aFa4N+++0Me1I2U++1dw/-Tmp-/build159308262941509457.tmp/GPS_AUTO_test.cpp.elf"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:250 02062477d08241baaaad24454342ab82
msgid ""
"The name of the file will depend on your sketch name, and the location will "
"vary depending on your system, but it will remain the same for a given "
"sketch until you quit and restart Arduino. Note that the directory "
"containing the file is deleted and re-created every time you compile the "
"sketch."
msgstr ""
"文件名取决于您的草图名称，位置因系统而异，但对于给定草图，在您退出并重新启动 Arduino "
"之前，路径保持不变。请注意，包含该文件的目录在每次编译草图时都会被删除并重新创建。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:256 0de7892699c745dd9a36cc4c0e57734a
msgid ""
"To debug this file with avr-gdb, use Arduino to compile and upload the "
"sketch to APM. Start AVaRICE as described above, then start GDB:"
msgstr "要使用 avr-gdb 调试此文件，请使用 Arduino 将草图编译并上传到 APM。按上述方法启动 AVaRICE，然后启动 GDB："

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:263 45800a26bf1448f8b2ef96d85c0813b5
msgid "You should see GDB start up:"
msgstr "您应该看到 GDB 启动："

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:277 a8d020a79777401291f2944183a3aef7
msgid "At the (gdb) prompt, tell GDB to connect to AVaRICE:"
msgstr "在（gdb）提示符处，告知 GDB 连接到 AVaRICE："

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:283 1ccb90a56001416a93f0807a216272e8
msgid ""
"This will stop the program running on the APM and tell you where it stopped:"
msgstr "这将停止 APM 上正在运行的程序，并告知您程序停止的位置："

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:295 ef24c73e8c6d4bcaa5392c9f05a566d2
msgid ""
"Use the 'continue' command to start the program running again, and hit "
"control-C to stop it once more."
msgstr "使用「continue」命令让程序重新运行，按 Ctrl-C 再次停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/jtag.rst:298 436f9c7b9d6b4363b7245ba50fd2d04b
msgid ""
"At this point, GDB can be used normally. Other debuggers that are compatible"
" with or build on GDB such as DDD or Insight can be used instead, as can "
"plugins for various IDEs like Eclipse."
msgstr ""
"此时，GDB 可以正常使用。也可以使用其他兼容 GDB 或基于 GDB 构建的调试器，如 DDD 或 Insight，以及各种 IDE（如 "
"Eclipse）的插件。"
